{
  "file_name": "f023.bf",
  "total_messages": 118,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "offset": "KEHAI_KIETA",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> The other's presence can\nno longer be felt.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "offset": "START_MESSAGE",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Hungry glances surround\nthe party...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "offset": "SOMEBODY_VOICE01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Voices are heard whispering.\n...At last. Our food is here...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "offset": "SOMEBODY_VOICE02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Voices are heard whispering.\nI'll devour her breasts...\nHer ass is delicious...\nI'm going to savor her legs.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "offset": "BATTLE1_1_1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "The Embryon!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "offset": "BATTLE1_1_2",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "You want to fight the Solids with us?\nI don't get it.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "offset": "BATTLE1_1_3",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It'd help a lot more if you let\nus help ourselves to your\ndelicious bodies.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "offset": "BATTLE1_1_ALG",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Get it, now?\nYou'll be better off if you help us out.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "offset": "HINT_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Er, yeah...\nI understand...\nEveryone's starving, though.\nWatch your back, okay? The others\nmight just attack you.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "offset": "SOMEBODY_VOICE03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Voices can be heard whispering...\nThey're so fresh...\n...it only makes me hungrier.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "offset": "SOMEBODY_VOICE04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Voices can be heard whispering.\nI thought they'd be food by now...\nLooks like they aren't as weak\nas we thought...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "offset": "SOMEBODY_VOICE05",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Voices can be heard whispering...\nOh, they're very strong.\n...We'll need more men...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "offset": "BATTLE1_3_1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It is as Jinana said.\nYou have already made it this far.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "offset": "BATTLE1_3_2",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "She granted us permission\nto devour you, if possible.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "offset": "BATTLE1_3_3",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "This is odd.\nHow was I unable to devour you?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "offset": "BATTLE1_3_4",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Hmph... I couldn't devour you...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "offset": "BATTLE1_3_5",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Well, to be honest...\nI'm in danger, now...\nSo, um...\nHEELP MEEE!!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "offset": "SOLID_RUNAWAY",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> That is a member of the Solids.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "offset": "GATELOCK_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Ha ha ha!\nClose the gate!\nDon't let them get away.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "offset": "BATTLE21_1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Ha ha ha! You idiots won't escape\nthat easily.\nAttack!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "offset": "AFT_BATTLE21",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Crap, they're getting away.\nAfter them!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "offset": "BATTLE22_1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Stop where you are!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "offset": "BATTLE22_2",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "We almost missed 'em...\nGood thing we were in a hurry.\nThere they are, at gate #7.\nOutnumber them!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "offset": "BATTLE23_1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Dammit!\nThey're already here...\nWeren't we supposed to stall\nthem here...?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "offset": "BATTLE24_1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I said wait, dammit!!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "offset": "CONFIRM_BATTLE",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> A presence is felt beyond\nthe door...\n> Open the door?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "offset": "WIN_BYAKKO",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Obtained White Orb.",
